Contour: nested shapes as frosted sections (nested_frost).

- hg.layer(..., { mask_nested = 0.15, nested_frost = 3.0 }): a nested shape
  (a pill on the bar) is no longer a second lens with its own rim. The pane
  keeps the outer outline's field right through it, and the shape's soft
  coverage only frosts the backdrop there, by the given blur strength: a
  blurred section of the same sheet. 0 (default) keeps the nested lens.

